<title>USA: Texaco Vice Chairman Krowe to retire.</title>
<headline>Texaco Vice Chairman Krowe to retire.</headline>
<dateline>WHITE PLAINS, N.Y. 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texaco Inc. Vice Chairman Allen Krowe will retire effective July 1 after reaching the company's normal retirement age for officers of 65, the company said Thursday.</p>
<p>Krowe joined the big oil company as senior vice president and chief financial officer in 1988 from International Business Machines Corp.</p>
